<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>The Opportunity Engine</title>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>

/* =========================
   COLOR THEME (LIGHT GREEN)
========================= */

:root{
--primary:#22c55e;
--dark:#14532d;
--soft:#f0fdf4;
--text:#0f172a;
--muted:#475569;
}

/* =========================
   BASE
========================= */

*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:Inter, sans-serif;
}

body{
background:var(--soft);
color:var(--text);
line-height:1.6;
}

/* =========================
   HERO (CLEAN + SOFT)
========================= */

.hero{
background:linear-gradient(135deg,#14532d,#22c55e);
color:white;
padding:70px 10%;
text-align:left;
}

.hero h1{
font-size:3rem;
margin-bottom:10px;
}

.hero p{
max-width:850px;
color:#eafff0;
margin-top:10px;
}

.hero small{
display:block;
margin-top:10px;
color:#d1fae5;
}

/* =========================
   SECTIONS
========================= */

section{
padding:80px 10%;
}

h2{
text-align:center;
font-size:2.2rem;
margin-bottom:15px;
}

.explain{
text-align:center;
max-width:900px;
margin:auto;
color:var(--muted);
}

/* =========================
   GRID
========================= */

.grid{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));
gap:22px;
margin-top:40px;
}

/* =========================
   CARDS
========================= */

.card{
background:white;
padding:25px;
border-radius:16px;
box-shadow:0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
transition:.2s;
border-top:4px solid var(--primary);
}

.card:hover{
transform:translateY(-6px);
}

.card h3{
color:var(--dark);
margin-bottom:10px;
}

.card p{
color:var(--muted);
margin-bottom:15px;
}

/* =========================
   BUTTONS (UPDATED)
========================= */

.btn{
display:inline-block;
padding:10px 16px;
background:var(--primary);
color:white;
border-radius:8px;
text-decoration:none;
font-size:.9rem;
font-weight:600;
}

.btn:hover{
background:#16a34a;
}

/* =========================
   TAGS
========================= */

.tags{
display:flex;
flex-wrap:wrap;
gap:10px;
justify-content:center;
margin-top:20px;
}

.tag{
background:#dcfce7;
color:#166534;
padding:6px 12px;
border-radius:20px;
font-size:.85rem;
}

/* =========================
   IMAGE GRID
========================= */

.image-grid{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));
gap:25px;
margin-top:40px;
}

.image-card{
background:white;
border-radius:16px;
overflow:hidden;
box-shadow:0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
}

.image-card img{
width:100%;
height:180px;
object-fit:cover;
}

.image-card h3{
padding:15px;
color:var(--dark);
}

.image-card p{
padding:0 15px 15px;
color:var(--muted);
}

/* =========================
   PATH TYPE CARDS
========================= */

.path-box{
background:white;
padding:25px;
border-radius:16px;
box-shadow:0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.06);
}

.path-box h3{
color:var(--dark);
margin-bottom:10px;
}

.path-box p{
color:var(--muted);
}

/* =========================
   FINAL
========================= */

.final{
background:linear-gradient(135deg,#14532d,#22c55e);
color:white;
text-align:center;
padding:80px 10%;
}

.final p{
max-width:800px;
margin:auto;
color:#eafff0;
}

</style>
</head>

<body>

<!-- ================= HERO ================= -->
<section class="hero">

<h1>The Opportunity Engine</h1>


<small>Explore options based on what you want to build — not just where you are now.</small>

</section>

<!-- ================= DASHBOARD ================= -->
<section>

<h2>Opportunity Dashboard</h2>

<p class="explain">
These are the major systems that move people from survival → stability → growth → freedom.
Each category serves a different purpose depending on your situation.
</p>


<div class="grid">

<div class="card">
<h3>🎓 Scholarships</h3>
<p>
Best for people who want formal education (college, trade school, certifications).
These reduce or eliminate tuition costs.
</p>
<a class="btn" href="https://www.fastweb.com" target="_blank">View Scholarships</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>💰 Grants</h3>
<p>
Free funding for housing, education, business, or emergencies.
No repayment required.
</p>
<a class="btn" href="https://www.grants.gov" target="_blank">View Grant Programs</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>🛠 Apprenticeships</h3>
<p>
Paid training programs where you learn skills while earning income.
Great for hands-on careers like tech, trades, healthcare.
</p>
<a class="btn" href="https://www.apprenticeship.gov" target="_blank">View Apprenticeships</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>📜 Certifications</h3>
<p>
Fast skill-building programs that help you qualify for jobs without a degree.
Common in tech, business, and healthcare.
</p>
<a class="btn" href="https://www.coursera.org" target="_blank">View Certifications</a>
</div>

</div>

</section>

<!-- ================= MORE PROGRAMS ================= -->
<section>

<h2>More Programs That Build Real Opportunity</h2>

<p class="explain">
These are often overlooked systems that provide income, experience, or advancement without traditional schooling.
</p>

<div class="grid">

<div class="path-box">
<h3>🚀 Startup Incubators</h3>
<p>Helps you turn ideas into businesses with funding, mentors, and resources.</p>
</div>

<div class="path-box">
<h3>🌍 Remote Work Programs</h3>
<p>Jobs you can do from anywhere (support, admin, writing, tech support).</p>
</div>

<div class="path-box">
<h3>🎤 Fellowships</h3>
<p>Paid leadership programs that include travel, training, and networking.</p>
</div>

<div class="path-box">
<h3>📚 Bootcamps</h3>
<p>Short intensive training programs that lead to jobs in tech or business.</p>
</div>

<div class="path-box">
<h3>📊 Workforce Development</h3>
<p>State-funded programs that train you for high-demand jobs at no cost.</p>
</div>

</div>

</section>

<!-- ================= PATH COMPARISON ================= -->
<section>

<h2>Two Paths People Can Take</h2>

<div class="grid">

<div class="path-box">
<h3>🎓 Traditional Education Path</h3>
<p>
Scholarships → College/Trade School → Internships → Degree → Career advancement
</p>
</div>

<div class="path-box">
<h3>⚙ Skill-Based Path</h3>
<p>
Certifications → Apprenticeships → Portfolio → Remote Job → Income Growth
</p>
</div>

</div>

</section>

<!-- ================= CATEGORIES ================= -->
<section>

<h2>Opportunity Categories</h2>

<div class="image-grid">

<div class="image-card">
<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1556740749-887f6717d7e4?w=1000">
<h3>Business Growth</h3>
<p>Funding, incubators, and startup support systems.</p>
</div>

<div class="image-card">
<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1521737604893-d14cc237f11d?w=1000">
<h3>Leadership Programs</h3>
<p>Fellowships, mentorships, and global exposure opportunities.</p>
</div>

</div>

</section>

<!-- ================= FINAL ================= -->
<section class="final">

<p>
Most people don’t fail from lack of ability — they fail from lack of exposure.
</p>

<br>
</section>

</body>
</html>
